WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.885
[MUSIC]

00:00:00.885 --> 00:00:04.516
Merges and acquisitions are one of the
most important means by which companies

00:00:04.516 --> 00:00:07.740
respond to changing economic and
financial conditions.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:11.720
It has become one of the favorite exit
strategies for many entrepreneurs and

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.100
startups especially
here in Silicon Valley.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:18.360
The unfortunate reality however is
that the majority of M&amp;A transactions

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:20.450
fail to provide the benefits.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:23.541
That companies predict or expect to gain.

00:00:23.541 --> 00:00:28.352
[MUSIC]

00:00:28.352 --> 00:00:33.119
This time for mergers and acquisitions
program is an interdisciplinary overview

00:00:33.119 --> 00:00:35.700
of all the major aspects of.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.470
I wanted to attend the program to better
understand how different companies and

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:41.990
different industries go through
the acquisition process from strategy to

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:42.730
integration.

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.500
It gives you exposure to a lot
of deals and a lot of thinking.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.680
&gt;&gt; I've had different
levels of MNA experience.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.390
What this program was able to do for

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:52.810
me was have that entire lifecycle,
talk about it.

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:54.720
With people who have had
different experiences and

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.909
help my company develop
hard core strategy.

00:00:56.909 --> 00:01:00.000
&gt;&gt; One of the keys to a successful
production is understanding

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.943
the perspective and the mind set
of the person on the other side.

00:01:02.943 --> 00:01:08.380
&gt;&gt; The negotiation class helps solidify
the concepts in a very practical manner.

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:11.470
&gt;&gt; And doing case studies outside of
what you're comfortable with is very,

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:12.310
